version: 0.18.0
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/CEMS-Lab/PhAST"
url: "https://cems-lab.github.io/PhAST/"
abstract: "A PyTorch finite-element solver for two-dimensional phase-field fracture and three-dimensional periodic voxel examples. The release includes dynamic and quasi-static 2D solvers, beta 3D fracture examples, HDF5 result output, and selected inversion recipes from the accompanying article. Differentiability is limited to the documented solver routes."
keywords:
  - phase-field fracture
  - finite element method
  - PyTorch
  - matrix-free solvers
  - differentiable mechanics
